Usage: /home/x/.local/zig/zig-x86_64-linux-0.15.2/zig build [steps] [options]

Steps:
  install (default)            Copy build artifacts to prefix path
  uninstall                    Remove build artifacts from prefix path
  dropin                       Build the drop-in WebGPU shared library
  ort-plugin-ep                Build the repo-only ONNX Runtime plugin EP scaffold shared library
